WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.867 --> 00:00:16.983
Dad and the kids were building a tree house.

2
00:00:16.984 --> 00:00:21.140
They had wood, nails, and tools.

3
00:00:21.141 --> 00:00:27.035
Harry picked up the tape measure.

4
00:00:27.036 --> 00:00:30.732
"Can I measure?" asked Oliver.

5
00:00:30.733 --> 00:00:34.917
"Not now," said Harry.

6
00:00:34.918 --> 00:00:38.402
"It's my job."

7
00:00:38.403 --> 00:00:43.097
Oliver sighed.

8
00:00:43.098 --> 00:00:45.913
Emmy marked the wood with a pencil.

9
00:00:45.914 --> 00:00:48.972
"Can I do that?" asked Oliver.

10
00:00:48.973 --> 00:00:52.416
"No," said Emmy.

11
00:00:52.417 --> 00:00:56.801
"I'm doing it."

12
00:00:56.802 --> 00:01:00.800
Oliver sighed again.

13
00:01:00.801 --> 00:01:06.138
Dad plugged in the saw.

14
00:01:06.139 --> 00:01:10.837
"Can I use the saw?" asked Oliver.

15
00:01:10.838 --> 00:01:15.038
"No," said Dad.

16
00:01:15.039 --> 00:01:21.240
"The saw is very dangerous."

17
00:01:21.241 --> 00:01:25.767
Oliver kicked the dirt.

18
00:01:25.768 --> 00:01:29.279
Dad cut the wood.

19
00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:33.056
The saw was really loud.

20
00:01:33.057 --> 00:01:40.556
Harry and Emmy covered their ears.

21
00:01:40.557 --> 00:01:43.851
Oliver picked up a small piece of wood.

22
00:01:43.852 --> 00:01:48.559
Then he walked away.

23
00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:53.068
Dad, Harry, and Emmy grabbed the hammers.

24
00:01:53.069 --> 00:01:57.366
They nailed the wood together.

25
00:01:57.367 --> 00:02:08.502
They built a ladder, a floor, and walls.

26
00:02:08.503 --> 00:02:12.718
Finally the tree house was finished.

27
00:02:12.719 --> 00:02:15.860
"Wow!" said Harry.

28
00:02:15.861 --> 00:02:23.401
"Our tree house looks great."

29
00:02:23.402 --> 00:02:27.359
"Where is Oliver?" asked Dad.

30
00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:30.663
"I don't know," said Emmy.

31
00:02:30.664 --> 00:02:50.677
They looked all over for Oliver.

32
00:02:50.678 --> 00:02:55.321
Harry heard a banging sound.

33
00:02:55.322 --> 00:03:01.201
"Someone is hammering," he said.

34
00:03:01.202 --> 00:03:06.274
They ran back to the tree house.

35
00:03:06.275 --> 00:03:08.616
"Whew!" said Emmy.

36
00:03:08.617 --> 00:03:12.412
"There's Oliver."

37
00:03:12.413 --> 00:03:15.704
"Thank you, Oliver!" said Dad.

38
00:03:15.705 --> 00:03:27.198
"Your sign is perfect!"
